  "_comment": "Layout of the user's Test Case template (Test cases.xlsx), reproduced cell for cell in the generated .xlsx. Headings are copied from the template; the one misspelling ('Desciption') is corrected to 'Description'. Widths are Excel column widths (characters). A column with key null is an empty gap column the template has (kept so later columns stay in the template's positions).",
